<header class="sg-head"><p class="featured-region">Anthem · 1912 · South &amp; Southeast Asia</p><h1 class="sg-title">Bande Utkala Janani</h1><p class="sg-local"><bdi lang="or">ବନ୍ଦେ ଉତ୍କଳ ଜନନୀ</bdi> / <bdi lang="or-Latn">Bandē Utkaḷa Jananī</bdi></p><p class="sg-kid" data-say>A song of 1912 in praise of &quot;Mother Utkala&quot;, the land of the Odia people. Since 2020 it is the anthem of the Indian state of Odisha.</p></header>
<dl class="sg-facts"><div><dt>Words</dt><dd>Laxmikanta Mohapatra</dd></div><div><dt>Music</dt><dd>not known (first recorded by Gokul Mohanty in 1932; the modern notation by Balakrushna Dash)</dd></div><div><dt>Culture</dt><dd>the Odia people; the Utkal Sammilani and the movement for a separate Odisha</dd></div><div><dt>Language</dt><dd>Odia</dd></div><div><dt>Place</dt><dd>Odisha, India</dd></div><div><dt>Date</dt><dd>written 1912; first sung at Balasore in 1912; state anthem of Odisha from 7 June 2020</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Anthem</dd></div><div><dt>The words</dt><dd>Public domain (words by Laxmikanta Mohapatra, written in 1912)</dd></div></dl>
<div class="sg-body">
<section class="sg-sec" id="story"><h2>The story</h2><p>&quot;<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bande-utkala-janani">Bande Utkala Janani</a>&quot; (&quot;Glory to the Mother Utkala!&quot;) is a patriotic poem in Odia written by Laxmikanta Mohapatra in 1912. Over the centuries outsiders, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mughal-empire">Mughals</a>, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maratha-empire">Marathas</a> and the British, had ruled <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/odisha">Odisha</a>, and its boundaries had changed with each of them. In the early 20th century a movement for a separate province gathered strength, led by the Utkal Sammilani, a federation of Odias. It influenced the young Mohapatra, who wrote this and other fiery songs with a patriotic aim. The song was first sung at the Utkal Sammilani's conference at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/balasore">Balasore</a> in 1912, and the Sammilani used it as a weapon in its campaign. The poet Banchhanidhi Mohanty, who was also a good singer, sang Mohapatra's patriotic songs throughout Odisha, and at a meeting at Bhadrak where Mohapatra was honoured, the young leader Harekrushna Mahtab said that the poet's songs had inspired him a great deal. On 1 April 1936 Odisha became the first state in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/british-india">British India</a> to be formed on a linguistic basis.</p><p>The music was first recorded by Gokul Mohanty in 1932, and the Odissi musician Balakrushna Dash arranged the modern notation, which was later adopted for the anthem. In the early 1990s the Chief Minister of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/odisha">Odisha</a>, Biju Patnaik, asked the Speaker of the Odisha Legislative Assembly, Yudhistir Das, to have the song played at the end of Assembly sessions, and in 1994 an all-party meeting chaired by Das adopted it to be played and sung at the valedictory session of the Assembly.</p><p>In 2020 the Chief Minister, Naveen Patnaik, encouraged people to recite &quot;<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bande-utkala-janani">Bande Utkala Janani</a>&quot; to raise the morale of the health workers fighting the coronavirus outbreak. On 7 June 2020 a meeting of the state cabinet that he chaired gave the poem the status of the anthem of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/odisha">Odisha</a>.</p></section>
<section class="sg-sec" id="meaning"><h2>What it says</h2><p>A hymn of praise to Utkala, the Odia homeland, addressed as a mother. It pictures a land that keeps its self-respect and dignity from confidence and strength rather than from fear, and calls on its people to honour her. The mood is devoted and proud.</p></section>
<section class="sg-sec" id="words"><h2>The words</h2><div class="sg-blocks"><div class="sg-lyrics sg-cols-1"><div class="sg-colhead" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sg-o">Odia</span></div><div class="sg-st"><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ବନ୍ଦେ ଉତ୍କଳ ଜନନୀ</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଚାରୁ ହାସମୟୀ ଚାରୁ ଭାଷମୟୀ,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଜନନୀ, ଜନନୀ, ଜନନୀ</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ବନ୍ଦେ ଉତ୍କଳ ଜନନୀ ।</span></p></div><div class="sg-st"><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ପୂତ-ପୟୋଧି-ବିଧୌତ-ଶରୀର,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ତାଳତମାଳ-ସୁଶୋଭିତ-ତୀର,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଶୁଭ୍ରତଟିନୀକୂଳ-ଶୀକର-ସମୀର,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଜନନୀ, ଜନନୀ, ଜନନୀ,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ବନ୍ଦେ ଉତ୍କଳ ଜନନୀ ।</span></p></div><div class="sg-st"><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଘନ ଘନ ବନଭୂମି ରାଜିତଅଙ୍ଗେ,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ନୀଳ ଭୂଧରମାଳା ସାଜେ ତରଙ୍ଗେ,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">କଳ କଳ ମୁଖରିତ ଚାରୁ ବିହଙ୍ଗେ,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଜନନୀ, ଜନନୀ, ଜନନୀ,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ବନ୍ଦେ ଉତ୍କଳ ଜନନୀ ।</span></p></div><div class="sg-st"><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ସୁନ୍ଦରଶାଳି-ସୁଶୋଭିତ-କ୍ଷେତ୍ର,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଜ୍ଞାନବିଜ୍ଞାନ-ପ୍ରଦର୍ଶିତ-ନେତ୍ର,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଯୋଗୀ ଋଷିଗଣ-ଊଟଜ-ପବିତ୍ର,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଜନନୀ, ଜନନୀ, ଜନନୀ,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ବନ୍ଦେ ଉତ୍କଳ ଜନନୀ ।</span></p></div><div class="sg-st"><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ସୁନ୍ଦର ମନ୍ଦିର ମଣ୍ଡିତ-ଦେଶା,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଚାରୁକଳାବଳି-ଶୋଭିତ-ବେଶା,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ପୁଣ୍ୟ ତୀର୍ଥଚୟା-ପୂର୍ଣ୍ଣ-ପ୍ରଦେଶା</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଜନନୀ, ଜନନୀ, ଜନନୀ,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ବନ୍ଦେ ଉତ୍କଳ ଜନନୀ ।</span></p></div><div class="sg-st"><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଉତ୍କଳ ସୁରବର-ଦର୍ପିତ-ଗେହା,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଅରିକୁଳ-ଶୋଣିତ-ଚର୍ଚ୍ଚିତ-ଦେହା,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ବିଶ୍ବଭୂମଣ୍ଡଳ-କୃତବର-ସ୍ନେହା,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଜନନୀ, ଜନନୀ, ଜନନୀ,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ବନ୍ଦେ ଉତ୍କଳ ଜନନୀ ।</span></p></div><div class="sg-st"><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">କବିକୁଳମୌଳି ସୁନନ୍ଦନ-ବନ୍ଦ୍ୟା,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଭୁବନ ବିଘୋଷିତ-କୀର୍ତ୍ତି ଅନିନ୍ଦ୍ୟା,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଧନ୍ୟେ, ପୁଣ୍ୟେ, ଚିର ଶରଣ୍ୟେ,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ଜନନୀ, ଜନନୀ, ଜନନୀ,</span></p><p class="sg-ln"><span class="sg-o" lang="or">ବନ୍ଦେ ଉତ୍କଳ ଜନନୀ ।|</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sg-credit"><p>Original: Laxmikanta Mohapatra (1912). Text from <a href="https://or.wikisource.org/wiki/%E0%AC%AC%E0%AC%A8%E0%AD%8D%E0%AC%A6%E0%AD%87_%E0%AC%89%E0%AC%A4%E0%AD%8D%E0%AC%95%E0%AC%B3_%E0%AC%9C%E0%AC%A8%E0%AC%A8%E0%AD%80" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikisource</a>; public domain.</p></div></section>
</div>
